IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `gdpr-core`
IMPORT `K2-art-1`

-- ============================================================================
-- K2-tests-art-1.l4 -- tests of Art 1(3) (src:18).  Expected values are written from the text.
-- Booleans are positional: the personal data move within the Union; the measure restricts or
-- prohibits the movement; the reason is connected with the protection of natural persons with
-- regard to the processing of personal data.
-- ============================================================================

§ `Art 1(3): a restriction or prohibition for data protection reasons is barred`

-- All three: the text says "shall be neither restricted nor prohibited for reasons connected with the protection of natural persons".
#ASSERT `Art 1(3) the restriction or prohibition of the free movement of personal data within the Union for reasons connected with data protection is barred` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The movement is not within the Union (a transfer to a country outside the Union): outside "within the Union"; the provision does not say.
#ASSERT `Art 1(3) the restriction or prohibition of the free movement of personal data within the Union for reasons connected with data protection is barred` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- No measure restricts or prohibits the movement: there is nothing for the provision to bar.
#ASSERT `Art 1(3) the restriction or prohibition of the free movement of personal data within the Union for reasons connected with data protection is barred` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A measure for another reason (public security): outside "for reasons connected with the protection of natural persons"; the text does not say.
#ASSERT `Art 1(3) the restriction or prohibition of the free movement of personal data within the Union for reasons connected with data protection is barred` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 1(3) the restriction or prohibition of the free movement of personal data within the Union for reasons connected with data protection is barred` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
